# Known MODERATE/HIGH/CRITICAL npm advisories in dashboard/e2e/package-lock.json
# (Playwright and axe-core, the browser smoke's own dependencies). Read by
# gate.mjs in the CI dashboard-e2e job. One `GHSA-id@package` per line (the
# advisory in that package only); the rest of the line is a note. A bare GHSA
# id is refused by the gate. A new advisory at moderate or above fails CI; so
# does a listed one that is no longer reported (prune it in the change that
# fixes it).
#
# Recorded 2026-10-22 (Round 32): `npm audit` reported 0 vulnerabilities at
# any level for playwright 1.64.1, playwright-core 1.64.1 and axe-core
# 4.14.0, so nothing is listed.
